    "Necromancer Mandates do (#6086): spell_group 2106092 holds Inscription: Fire 561248/561249/561250 and",
    "Greater 561251 (Runemaster, class 32), 2106093 holds Fire Protection 582533 ranks and Greater 582536",
    "(Guardian, class 18), both rule 4 (SPELL_GROUP_STACK_RULE_EXCLUSIVE_HIGHEST) and lower than 2113018.",
    "Amounts: rank 1 561248 base points 29 (+30), 561250 and both Greater forms base points 59 (+60).",
    "Expected on a grouped warrior ally: a weaker cast from another caster of the same class is refused and",
    "the Greater buff stays; an equal cast replaces it; a cast from another class replaces the older buff.",
    "Fire resistance stays at +60."
  ],
